SUMMARY (GCS)

PCB designs (Wash/Zoë/Emma capes for ground station, gimbal controller, etc.) are
licensed under CERN-OHL-W v2. Mechanical gimbal CAD is also CERN-OHL-W.

Malcolm firmware (GCS control software) is licensed under MIT.

Documentation is licensed under CC BY 4.0.

For attribution and contribution guidelines, see:
  ../docs/attribution_and_licensing.md
  ../CONTRIBUTING.md (if present)

